# Omarchy default web apps this machine has decided against.
#
# One launcher name per line, matching the .desktop basename Omarchy ships in
# $OMARCHY_PATH/applications. Deleting one by hand is not enough:
# omarchy-refresh-applications copies EVERY default back into
# ~/.local/share/applications, so the decision has to live here where
# `loaf debloat` can re-assert it after each update.
Basecamp
ChatGPT
HEY
WhatsApp
